90, 695). He is also singing and dancing as part of the group.\n*   **Performer 4 (Dark Jacket with "The" Logo):** In frame 680, a performer wearing a dark jacket with a visible white logo that appears to say "The" is seen dancing energetically.\n*   **Other Performers:** Additional performers in various outfits (including white shirts and patterned jackets) are visible, contributing to the group performance. The stage is dynamic, with performers moving and changing positions.\n\n**3. Solo Performance Segment (Frames 705-720):**\n*   The video cuts to a different performer, **solo on stage**. This individual has reddish-brown hair and is wearing a light-colored (possibly white or light yellow) patterned shirt and dark pants. He is singing into a microphone, illuminated by a single blue spotlight. Another performer in a light blue shirt is visible to the left, but the focus is on the soloist.\n\n**4. Return to Group Performance (Frames 745-765):**\n*   The video transitions back to a group performance. The performer with light-colored hair (likely Seungri) is seen again, wearing a dark suit and white shirt, singing into a microphone.\n*   The stage background features a striking black and white checkered pattern with converging lines, creating a visual effect.\n*   Other performers in dark outfits are visible on stage, dancing and performing alongside the main singer.\n\n**Summary of Performers After Seungri:**\n*   The video does not show a clear, distinct *solo* performer immediately after Seungri\'s solo. Instead, it transitions to a **group performance** featuring multiple members, including a prominent performer in a blue patterned jacket and another in a black leather jacket.\n*   Later in the sequence, there is a **solo performance** by a different individual with reddish-brown hair in a light-colored patterned shirt.\n*   The video then returns to a **group performance** with Seungri and other members, set against a checkered background.\n\nNo text on screens